# Lab 8: Catch the Call Scammer

## About This Lab

In this final exercise, I investigated network traffic associated with a VoIP call. The objective was to examine the communication and use the available evidence to identify a suspected scammer.

## What I Worked On

- Examining captured VoIP traffic.
- Investigating call-related network communication.
- Analysing relevant packet information.
- Examining the recorded call as part of the investigation.
- Completing all 10 tasks in the lab.

## What I Learned

I learned how network traffic analysis can be applied to VoIP communication and how examining call-related data can support investigations into suspicious activity.

